                      },
                      "group": "",
                      "groupIndex": 0,
                      "text": "- ASC (Automatic Self-Calibration): ON by default.\n- Best when CO2 drops close to outdoor levels at least weekly\n(good ventilation / room unoccupied).\n- ASC adjusts slowly over days (not instantly).\n- With ASC ON, manual calibration is usually \nnot needed.",
                      "textType": "literal",
                      "longMode": "WRAP",
                      "recolor": false
                    }
