                  "group": "",
                  "groupIndex": 0,
                  "text": "Temperature affects comfort, productivity, and sleep quality. Thresholds based on ASHRAE Standard 55 (thermal comfort) and WHO housing recommendations. Optimal range helps maintain focus and prevents fatigue. Extremes cause discomfort, drowsiness, or difficulty concentrating. Prolonged exposure to poor conditions may affect health.",
