                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "group": "",
                  "groupIndex": 0,
                  "text": "CO₂ indicates indoor air quality and ventilation effectiveness. Thresholds based on ASHRAE and German Federal Environment Agency (UBA) guidelines. Outdoor air is ~400ppm. Levels above 1000ppm reduce cognitive performance; above 1500ppm cause drowsiness and headaches. Good ventilation keeps CO₂ low for optimal focus and health.",
                  "textType": "literal",
                  "longMode": "WRAP",
                  "recolor": false
                },
