                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "group": "",
                      "groupIndex": 0,
                      "text": "Mold risk indicates the likelihood of mold growth based on humidity and temperature conditions. High humidity above 70% combined with warm temperatures creates ideal conditions for mold and dust mites. Mold spores cause allergies, respiratory issues, and property damage. Monitor corners, bathrooms, and poorly ventilated areas. Keep humidity below 60% to prevent growth.",
                      "textType": "literal",
                      "longMode": "WRAP",
                      "recolor": false
                    },
                    {
                      "objID": "1f620f40-021b-4e0b-fb9a-c882d0976b75",
