                      "group": "",
                      "groupIndex": 0,
                      "text": "24-hour pressure change reveals weather trends and prolonged stress on the body. Large swings indicate major fronts or storms passing through. Sensitive individuals may experience sustained fatigue, mood changes, or worsening chronic pain. Use for daily planning and anticipating symptoms over coming hours.",
